<title>JAPAN: Nomura up on speculation of light penalty.</title>
<headline>Nomura up on speculation of light penalty.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura Securities Co Ltd's shares rose in the Thursday morning session as investors speculated that punishment for the brokerage's dealings with a corporate racketeer would be lighter than expected, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0116 GMT, the shares were up 40 yen at 1,570, with trade totalling 3.3 million shares.</p>
